# admin.html (the CMS) is now PUBLISHED — it logs in with a GitHub
# fine-grained token and commits content via the GitHub API. The token
# is entered in-browser and never committed, so publishing the page is
# safe. The "noindex,nofollow" meta keeps it out of search engines.

